<ShowcaseShell title="Marea — Beach Club & Mediterranean Dining" description="A complete multilingual beach club concept by RxN Developing." brand="marea" variant="marea" home="/showcase/marea-beach-club/" nav={mareaNav} cta={mareaCta}><section class="marea-hero"><img src="/assets/showcases/marea/sunset.jpg" alt="Marea beach club at sunset" /><div class="marea-hero__copy"><T class="marea-kicker" en="Beach club · Mediterranean kitchen · Puglia" it="Beach club · Cucina mediterranea · Puglia" fr="Beach club · Cuisine méditerranéenne · Pouilles" es="Beach club · Cocina mediterránea · Apulia" /><T as="h1" en="A whole day by the sea." it="Un'intera giornata sul mare." fr="Toute une journée face à la mer." es="Un día entero junto al mar." /><T as="p" en="From the first swim to dinner under the lights: reserve your sunbed, lunch, water experience, and sunset table in one place." it="Dal primo bagno alla cena sotto le luci: prenota lettino, pranzo, esperienza in acqua e tavolo al tramonto in un solo posto." fr="Du premier bain au dîner sous les lumières : réservez transat, déjeuner, expérience nautique et table au coucher du soleil." es="Desde el primer baño hasta la cena: reserva hamaca, almuerzo, experiencia acuática y mesa al atardecer." /><div class="marea-actions"><a class="marea-button marea-button--coral" href="/showcase/marea-beach-club/book/"><T en="Plan your day" it="Organizza la giornata" fr="Planifier la journée" es="Planifica tu día" /></a><a class="marea-button" href="/showcase/marea-beach-club/dining/"><T en="Explore the kitchen" it="Scopri la cucina" fr="Découvrir la cuisine" es="Descubrir la cocina" /></a></div></div></section><section class="marea-section"><div class="marea-head"><div><T class="marea-kicker" en="One place, four moments" it="Un luogo, quattro momenti" fr="Un lieu, quatre moments" es="Un lugar, cuatro momentos" /><T as="h2" en="Build the day around your rhythm." it="Costruisci la giornata sul tuo ritmo." fr="Construisez la journée à votre rythme." es="Diseña el día a tu ritmo." /></div><T as="p" en="An integrated hospitality experience connecting beach services, restaurant availability, activities, and evening reservations." it="Un'esperienza integrata che collega servizi spiaggia, disponibilità del ristorante, attività e prenotazioni serali." fr="Une expérience intégrée entre plage, restaurant, activités et réservations du soir." es="Una experiencia integrada entre playa, restaurante, actividades y reservas nocturnas." /></div><div class="marea-day"><article><span>08:30</span><T as="h3" en="Morning beach" it="Mattina in spiaggia" fr="Matin à la plage" es="Mañana de playa" /><T as="p" en="Reserved cabana, towel service, breakfast, and first-row sea access." it="Cabana riservata, teli, colazione e accesso in prima fila." fr="Cabane réservée, serviettes, petit-déjeuner et premier rang." es="Cabaña reservada, toallas, desayuno y primera fila." /></article><article><span>13:00</span><T as="h3" en="Long lunch" it="Pranzo lento" fr="Long déjeuner" es="Almuerzo largo" /><T as="p" en="Raw bar, coastal vegetables, handmade pasta, and local catch." it="Crudi, ortaggi costieri, pasta fatta a mano e pescato locale." fr="Crus, légumes côtiers, pâtes maison et pêche locale." es="Crudos, verduras costeras, pasta casera y pesca local." /></article><article><span>16:30</span><T as="h3" en="On the water" it="In acqua" fr="Sur l'eau" es="En el agua" /><T as="p" en="Paddle, sailing, and private boat experiences from the club dock." it="Paddle, vela ed esperienze in barca privata dal pontile." fr="Paddle, voile et bateau privé depuis le ponton." es="Paddle, vela y barco privado desde el muelle." /></article><article><span>19:45</span><T as="h3" en="Sunset table" it="Tavolo al tramonto" fr="Table au coucher du soleil" es="Mesa al atardecer" /><T as="p" en="Aperitivo, live acoustic music, and dinner as the coastline changes colour." it="Aperitivo, musica acustica e cena mentre la costa cambia colore." fr="Aperitivo, musique acoustique et dîner au soleil couchant." es="Aperitivo, música acústica y cena frente al atardecer." /></article></div></section><section class="marea-feature"><div><img src="/assets/showcases/marea/beach.jpg" alt="Marea beach experience" /></div><div class="marea-feature__copy"><T class="marea-kicker" en="The Marea day pass" it="Il day pass Marea" fr="Le day pass Marea" es="El day pass Marea" /><T as="h2" en="One booking. No loose ends." it="Una prenotazione. Nessun pensiero." fr="Une réservation. Rien à gérer." es="Una reserva. Todo resuelto." /><T as="p" en="The interactive journey combines beach position, dining time, optional experiences, party size, and preferences into a single request." it="Il percorso interattivo unisce posizione in spiaggia, orario del ristorante, attività opzionali, ospiti e preferenze in una sola richiesta." fr="Le parcours réunit emplacement, restaurant, activités, convives et préférences dans une seule demande." es="El recorrido reúne ubicación, restaurante, actividades, personas y preferencias en una única solicitud." /></div></section></ShowcaseShell>
